SDS-2525423 Matrix InitializationRequest In E-Stop
    [Documentation]    State x request matrix cell: InitializationRequest received in "E-Stop" (generated from
    ...    catalog/state-matrix.toml). SDS-2525423: SMM begins the initialization process only after the
    ...    InitializationRequest message is received over the is/iw/rx topic and the system state is
    ...    "NotInitialized". Note: When the InitializationRequest message is received over the is/iw/rx topic,
    ...    appSMM transmits the 'InitializeCmd' command to rtc_appl, only when the system state is
    ...    'NotInitialized'. So in E-Stop no initialization starts (the state stays E-Stop) and no
    ...    InitializeCmd is sent. Open: Does appSMM answer an InitializationRequest in E-Stop with an
    ...    InitializationResponse, and with which Status?
    [Tags]    SDS-2525423    spechash:9bb164c6    review:pending
    E-Stop    InitializationRequest    ${EMPTY}    ${EMPTY}    unchanged    InitializeCmd

